      "body": "Blocking finding:\n\n[P1] Remove the tracked scratch/debug bundle before merge. `probe_tmp/dune` makes `probe2.re` part of the repository-wide `@check` target, but `probe_tmp/probe2.re:191` calls the removed `CanonicalCompletion.chip_at_caret`. The current Fast checks job therefore fails with `Error: Unbound value CanonicalCompletion.chip_at_caret` before quick tests can run. This looks like an accidental artifact bundle rather than product code: the PR also adds two exploratory patch files, probe executables, `CLAUDE.md`, and `plans`, where `plans` is an absolute symlink to `/Users/andrewblinn/Dropbox/projects/hazel/plans` and will be broken for every other checkout. Please remove these local artifacts (or intentionally move/maintain any probe that should survive) so `dune build @check --profile release` passes.\n\nVerification: `dune build @test-quick --profile dev` passes locally with 3,821 tests; the focused Derivation/DerivationCase run also passes (65 tests). GitHub Full tests are still running at review time, while Fast checks fail for the compile error above.",
